WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.650
Have you ever wondered what SCP-426, I Am
a Toaster, might want?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:10.570
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-426 while

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:15.100
I was resting on a table in the center of
my containment cell, and this was the result:

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.550
"The photograph is zoomed-in further than
the location of photography would suggest,

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:24.780
and has aspect-ratio, quality, and distortion
consistent with the front-facing camera of

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.260
modern smartphones.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.060
I am still a toaster."

